ning. <i>Advances in</i> <i>Neural Information Processing Systems</i>, 36, 2024.</li>\",\n              \"polygon\": [\n                [\n                  81.28125,\n                  300.1639099121094\n                ],\n                [\n                  540.87890625,\n                  300.1639099121094\n                ],\n                [\n                  540.87890625,\n                  332.0201110839844\n                ],\n                [\n                  81.28125,\n                  332.0201110839844\n                ]\n              ],\n              \"bbox\": [\n                81.28125,\n                300.1639099121094,\n                540.87890625,\n                332.0201110839844\n              ],\n              \"children\": null,\n              \"section_hierarchy\": {\n                \"1\": \"/page/0/SectionHeader/0\",\n                \"2\": \"/page/17/SectionHeader/4\"\n              },\n              \"images\": {}\n            },\n            {\n              \"id\": \"/page/17/ListItem/10\",\n              \"block_type\": \"ListItem\",\n              \"html\": \"<li block-type=\\\"ListItem\\\"><span id=\\\"page-17-5\\\"></span>[6] Yunfan Gao, Yun Xiong, Xinyu Gao, Kangxiang Jia, Jinliu Pan, Yuxi Bi, Yi Dai, Jiawei Sun, Meng Wang, and Haofen Wang. Retrieval-augmented generation for large language models: A survey, 2023.</li>\",\n              \"polygon\": [\n                [\n                  80.68359375,\n                  336.9522399902344\n                ],\n                [\n                  540.87890625,\n                  336.9522399902344\n                ],\n                [\n                  540.87890625,\n                  357.8540954589844\n                ],\n                [\n                  80.68359375,\n                  357.8540954589844\n                ]\n              ],\n              \"bbox\": [\n                80.68359375,\n                336.9522399902344,\n                540.87890625,\n     